-- LAYER-1 TESTS for the definitions of the Act: the rest of s 2, s 37(1) to (15), s 44, s 50.
-- Expected values are written by hand from the quoted text (each rule's @ref gives the raw line).  Each definition has at least one test that is
-- true and one that is not; a percentage test sits on both sides of the 12% and 30% boundaries, which the text puts at "12% or more but less than 30%"
-- and "30% or more".

